Lee Jones wrote:
> 
> > > > > Commit '166a34d ASoC: ab8500: Fix invalid cast to long pointer'
> > > > > rather carelessly converts find_next_bit() to fls() (find last
> > > > > bit set), which are not the same.
> > > > 
> > > > Does it break on the real machines?
